#: lock/lockprocess.cc:856
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<h1>Screen Locking Failed!</h1>Your screen was not locked because the "
"<i>kcheckpass</i> program was not able to check your password. This is "
"usually the result of kcheckpass not being installed correctly. If you "
"installed KDE yourself, reinstall kcheckpass as root. If you are using a "
"pre-compiled package, contact the packager."
msgstr ""
"<h1>skerm sluit van gevaal!</h1>jou skerm was nie geslote omdat die "
"<i>kcheckpass</i> program was nie in staat aan bevestig jou wagwoord.  "
"hierdie is gewoonlik die resultaat van kcheckpass nie te wees geïnstalleer "
"korrek.  as jy geïnstalleer kde jouself, herinstalleer kcheckpass as root.  "
"as jy word te gebruik 'n pre-compiled paket, kontak die verpakker."

